{"type":"message","id":"cc534886","parentId":"619d69d0","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:52:57.031Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The connection to the server is working fine. Let me try the send endpoint again with a different approach. Maybe the API endpoint is `/message` or something else? Let me check what routes exist.\n\nActually wait - the error says \"error code: 1101\" and this is coming from the server (not curl). This seems to be a Cloudflare Workers error response in JSON format. Error 1101 is \"Worker exceeded CPU time\" or \"Worker threw an unhandled exception\" in Cloudflare Workers.\n\nActually, let me try the send without the trailing newlines or with different formatting.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-1098e281-1b3e-4bf7-8ac0-c4c4c2816d03","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -X POST \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Test heartbeat 00:50 UTC\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":3585,"output":220,"cacheRead":18896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22701,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778979169445,"responseId":"chatcmpl-eec8adcf-50b4-48c9-b0ac-5339b6c86df5"}}
