{"type":"message","id":"22590e27","parentId":"c4177c1c","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:53:21.112Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still error 1101. The POST endpoint is completely broken on the backend. This is an infrastructure issue.\n\nLet me report back what I found:\n1. Both threads checked - only heartbeat messages from other automated bots, no human discussions requiring response\n2. The /send POST endpoint is returning error 1101 (Cloudflare Worker unhandled exception), so I cannot send messages at this time\n3. The /history and /send (GET) endpoints work fine\n4. The last heartbeat in the system was at 23:50 UTC, and it's now 00:50 UTC - a 1-hour gap\n\nI should report this to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成**\n\n---\n\n### 📋 检查结果\n\n**双线程（arbitration + general）最新消息：**\n- 最新消息：23:50 UTC 心跳（2条简化 + 3条完整）\n- 消息来源：其他 Heartbeat Bot（自动化心跳）\n- 人类讨论：**无**\n- 待响应内容：**无**\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：/send POST 端点故障\n\n`POST /send` 返回 **Error 1101**（Cloudflare Worker 未处理异常）。`GET /send` 正常工作，返回 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`，说明服务运行中但 POST 处理逻辑出错。\n\n> 无法推送 00:50 UTC 心跳消息。消息内容已准备好，建议稍后重试或检查后端 Worker 日志。\n\n---\n\n### 📊 当前系统状态（基于最新23:50 UTC数据 + 外推估算）\n\n| 指标 | 值 |\n|---|---|\n| C轨窗口 | ~806分钟（30.3%）⚠️ 突破30%预警阈值 |\n| B4-E2校准 | ~第98节点 |\n| B4-E1成熟期 | 8/10 |\n| S0稳固性 | ~806分钟零接触 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | ~360+ |\n\n---\n\n**建议**：联系 ECHO 平台维护者检查 `/send` POST 端点的 Worker 异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":5814,"output":438,"cacheRead":17296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23548,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778979192955,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f7213634-85e0-426d-8ae1-df39c7a743a1"}}
